{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908770/extras/25bb9284f5056f3c7e763500b77c2e5c.avif?t=1757051601\" width=1500 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Welcome to Dystopian Finland!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The living proof that any empire can be completely destroyed with a couple of terrible decisions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908770/extras/63d3110656f2b2222b8ac5fd712b0c10.avif?t=1757051601\" width=1500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first chapter of this visual novel, you will follow Mari on a journey through the ruins of her beloved country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All thanks to the decisions of an incompetent government seeking total control over the population of what was once the happiest country in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the details, return home safely, and remember the events you didn't know you had forgotten in the first place to fulfill your purpose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Short (?)&quot; (1+ hour approx.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abstract graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908770/extras/84d311292ffcc4089be1f6f87c7b5cb4.avif?t=1757051601\" width=1500 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAQ:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_parag